# Generated review pages. `scripts/preview-bridges.mjs` builds preview/bridges.html
# out of the pghMode source on demand, so committing it would only ever be a
# second copy of src/ waiting to fall behind it.
preview/

# Local AI-assistant scratch: session settings and git worktrees. A worktree
# here is a second checkout inside the repo, so leaving it untracked still
# leaves it in `git status`. To share a settings file with the team later, add
# a negation for it (e.g. `!.claude/settings.json`) — this rule hides it.
.claude/
